OL,4,CTraining firm to open campus at closed 
OL,5,Csixth form                             
OL,6,GA closed sixth form building is to be  
OL,7,Greopened to offer vocational courses   
OL,8,Grun by a private training provider.    
OL,10,FReagit Engineering Training will take  
OL,11,Fover the centre at Sheringham High     
OL,12,FSchool in Norfolk within the next 12   
OL,13,Fmonths.                                
OL,15,FSynergy Multi Academy Trust (SMAT),    
OL,16,Fwhich runs 14 schools in the county,   
OL,17,Fis teaming up with the company, which  
OL,18,Fhas an engineering training centre in  
OL,19,FNorwich.                               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
