OL,4,CDaughter in court on assisted suicide  
OL,5,Ccharge                                 
OL,6,GA woman charged with assisted suicide  
OL,7,Gfollowing the death of her mother has  
OL,8,Gappeared in court.                     
OL,10,FEmma Nightingale from Lowestoft,       
OL,11,FSuffolk, is charged with "providing    
OL,12,Ftablets" that ended the life of Lorna  
OL,13,FNightingale in December 2025.          
OL,15,FLorna Nightingale, 70, was found dead  
OL,16,Fat a property in Blackhorse Road,      
OL,17,FWalthamstow, east London on 11         
OL,18,FDecember.                              
OL,20,FEmma Nightingale, 37, appeared in the  
OL,21,Fdock at Westminster Magistrates' Court 
OL,22,Fon Thursday. No plea was entered. G2/4 
