OL,4,C'Crazy' texts sent before elderly      
OL,5,Cmum's death, court told                
OL,6,GThe founder of Browns Brasseries has   
OL,7,Gdescribed text messages sent by his    
OL,8,Gsister on the night of their elderly   
OL,9,Gmother's death as "crazy nonsense".    
OL,11,FOxford restaurateur Jeremy Mogford,    
OL,12,F79, and Sarah Pickering, 72, are       
OL,13,Faccused of attempting to murder their  
OL,14,F100-year-old mother Pamela Mogford by  
OL,15,Fgiving her excessive amounts of        
OL,16,Fmorphine at her home in Bledlow,       
OL,17,FBuckinghamshire, in February 2022.     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
